    "text": "This procedure loads fresh fuel into reactor cell `RX-3A`. It does not affect backup cell `RX-3B`.\n\n1. Verify that license `NRC-8801` is current, cell `RX-3A` coolant flow shows **Normal**, and control rods indicate `full-insertion`.\n2. Execute `hyperctl status RX-3A`.\n3. WARNING: The following step initiates irreversible fuel loading into cell `RX-3A`. Emergency shutdown after loading requires regulatory approval.\n   Only if output shows `temp=ambient pressure=nominal`, execute `hyperctl load-fuel RX-3A --license NRC-8801`.\n4. After loading completes, run `hyperctl verify RX-3A` and confirm output is `fuel=loaded rods=inserted`.",
